- rule_id: PGM003
  severity: Critical
  message: "CONCURRENTLY cannot run inside a transaction. The COMMIT on line 2 ends the migration tool's transaction, but the tool runs the statements after it in a new one. Move this statement to a migration of its own and disable transactions for it (runInTransaction=\"false\" in Liquibase)."
  file: migrations/002.sql
  start_line: 3
  end_line: 3
